---
import { site } from '../site';
---

<section id="about" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl scroll-mt-24 px-5 py-20 sm:py-28">
	<div class="grid items-center gap-12 md:grid-cols-2">
		<!-- Portrait placeholder — swap for a photo of Jim -->
		<div class="reveal polaroid relative mx-auto w-full max-w-sm -rotate-2 border-8 border-starlight bg-starlight shadow-xl">
			<div class="flex aspect-[4/5] flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-gradient-to-br from-dusk-light via-dusk to-night">
				<span class="font-display text-6xl text-coral">J</span>
				<span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-starlight/50">
					Portrait
				</span>
			</div>
			<p class="bg-starlight py-3 text-center font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-night">
				The man himself
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="reveal">
			<p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-coral">About</p>
			<h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-5xl text-starlight sm:text-6xl">
				Meet Jim
			</h2>
			<!-- Placeholder bio — replace with Jim's real story -->




			<p class="mt-6 leading-relaxed font-light text-starlight/85">
				Per, V’d Est. Deorum, nibh aequaliter, quo ullo privatus iste m porta lategue sem semper vero omnis vero. P eget risus te fusce iusto, eaque mirum, rem nactus eros hac netus dis uidem ultimum spiral quis quae non aut unde.
			</p>
			<p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed font-light text-starlight/85">
				Error aut id me superstites, ea per’ad aut ad ille apollinis. Ad invidia vacare, ac pectora. Sunt quod consuetudium mus y vel hac’li eius si esse iis.
			</p>
			<a
				href={site.instagram.url}
				class="mt-6 inline-block font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-coral underline decoration-coral/40 underline-offset-8 transition-colors hover:text-blush"
			>
				Follow the work on Instagram →
			</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
